{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">正味集團擬以1供6比例，供股集資逾1.61億元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">每股供股價0.4元，較上日收市價折讓逾兩成八，涉及發行最多4.03億股，集資所得全部用於償還銀行借款。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T01:08:47.868156+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}